+
+This process owns NO CUDA context (pull design): ``CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES`` is
+emptied at startup so any accidental device use raises instead of silently
+allocating ~270 MiB of context per card.
 
 The TP workers within one DP rank receive identical inputs, so the CPU result
 is computed once per DP rank and fanned out to all of its TP ranks.
